      "text": "```\nGLOBAL PRODUCTION (~40 million tonnes/year, 2020):\n  Agaricus bisporus: ~38% (button/cremini/portobello)\n  Lentinula edodes: ~25% (shiitake)\n  Pleurotus: ~15% (oyster)\n  Flamulina: ~8% (enoki)\n  Others: ~14%"
