        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Edible Fungi",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "FLAVOR CHEMISTRY:\n  Lentinan: β-glucan polysaccharide; immunomodulatory claims\n  Lenthionine: volatile sulfide (1,2,3,5,6-pentathiepane)\n    → Generated from lentinic acid by enzyme action during cooking\n    → KEY flavor component; increases dramatically with drying\n  Ergosterol: provitamin D₂; UV exposure on dried shiitake → vitamin D₂\n    → Dried shiitake placed gill-up in sun = excellent vitamin D source"
    }
